  "description": "⭐<em> Brigit’s Bakery invites little heroes and their grown-ups on a PAWsome sightseeing adventure through the heart of London. Hop aboard a classic red Routemaster for the </em><strong><em>PAW Patrol Afternoon Tea Bus Tour</em></strong><em>, where families join Ryder and the pups on a city-wide mission to find the missing Mayor Goodway and Chickaletta.</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n🎉 <strong>PAWsome Tuesdays are here!</strong> Every <strong>Tuesday throughout August</strong>, <strong>child tickets are 50% off</strong>. It's the perfect time to join Ryder and the pups for an unforgettable family adventure through London. Book now while the offer lasts!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n🎄<strong>Don’t miss the festive adventure! Experience London’s iconic Christmas lights with the PAW Patrol Christmas Lights Bus Tour—book your tickets </strong><a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/599709?thm=12312\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>here</strong></a><strong>.</strong>🎄<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🐾 Join the rescue mission with PAW Patrol as you search for clues across the city<br>\r\n🚌 Cruise past iconic landmarks including Big Ben, Westminster Abbey and Battersea Power Station<br>\r\n🎮 Each table has its own mission screen where Ryder guides junior patrollers through puzzles and challenges<br>\r\n🎤 Enjoy sing-alongs, games and family fun entertainment from the onboard host<br>\r\n🧁 Indulge in a playful PAW Patrol-themed afternoon tea with delicious treats for kids and grown-ups<em>&nbsp;</em><br>\r\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for PAW Patrol Afternoon Tea Bus Tour <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/646731\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Dietary Requirements</strong><br>\r\n<strong>🚩After booking, you’ll be asked to select your menu and share any dietary requirements. Please double-check your choices, as they cannot be changed once submitted.🚩</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: 90 minutes&nbsp;<br>\r\n📍 <strong>Departure: Outside the Corinthia Hotel, 10 Northumberland Avenue, WC2N 5AP</strong><br>\r\n👤Age requirement: 2+<br>\r\n❗<strong> Any allergies must be emailed and confirmed by management at bus@b-bakery.com </strong>❗<br>\r\n♿Accessibility: please refer to the <a href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/plan/faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FAQs</a><br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/bus-tours/paw-patrol-london-bus-tour\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nMayor Goodway and Chickaletta have gone missing in London, and the PAW Patrol needs YOUR help to find them. Junior patrollers, are you ready to climb aboard the Routemaster bus and set off on a city-wide rescue mission?&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAs you roll past London’s famous sights, follow clues and solve challenges on your table’s PAW Patrol mission screen. An onboard entertainer keeps the fun going with games and sing-alongs, while every young hero receives a PAW Patrol Activity Book to complete their mission and a special edition travel cup to take home. And when it’s time to refuel, Brigit’s expert pastry team serves a delicious afternoon tea packed with sweet and savoury treats inspired by everyone’s favourite rescue pups.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nReady to save the day? Gather your team, hop on board, and make some tail-wagging memories on this unforgettable London adventure. Get your tickets today!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n©2026 &amp;TM Spin Master Ltd. All rights reserved.",
